TITLE: Vibration (flightmd_core/analysers/vibration.py)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-DYN-020
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Vibration module declaration
STATEMENT: >>>
`VibrationAnalyser` declares `name` `"vibration"`, `display_name` `"Vibration Analysis"`, `weight` 20.0,
`required_any` `["vehicle_imu_status", "vibration", "sensor_accel"]` and `optional_topics` `["vehicle_status",
"vehicle_land_detected"]`, so `is_applicable` returns False when none of the three bare topic names is present.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
