[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Estimator health (flightmd_core/analysers/ekf.py)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-DYN-038
STATUS: Active
TITLE: EKF module declaration
STATEMENT: >>>
`EKFAnalyser` declares `name` `"ekf"`, `display_name` `"EKF Health Analysis"`, `weight` 20.0, `required_any`
`["estimator_status", "estimator_innovation_test_ratios", "ekf_test_ratios"]` and `optional_topics`
`["vehicle_status", "vehicle_land_detected"]`, so `is_applicable` is True with any one of the three and False
with none.
<<<
