STATEMENT: >>>
`_advice` returns the `SENSOR_ADVICE` sentence for the sensor group (`gps`, `height`, `mag`, `airspeed`,
`range`, `flow`), or `GENERIC_RATIO_ADVICE` for no known group, and appends " Make sure EKF2_GPS_DELAY matches
the receiver." with `params` `["EKF2_GPS_DELAY"]` only for the pair (`px4`, `gps`); every other pair gives an
empty `params`. No function in `ekf.py` makes a `ParamRecommendation`.
