[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-DYN-059
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Apogee finding and result
STATEMENT: >>>
For a qualifying log `AscentProfileAnalyser.analyse` adds a finding of severity good, `kind` `ascent.apogee`,
category `ascent_profile`, confidence 1.0, at the apogee time, and writes the key metrics `apogee_altitude_m`
and `time_to_apogee_s` (1 place each) together with those of `_analyse_launch` and `_analyse_deployment`. The
findings are those of the launch, then the apogee, then the deployment.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
